WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.074
- Why do Americans put kale in everything?

00:00:03.074 --> 00:00:04.106
(upbeat music)

00:00:04.106 --> 00:00:06.443
(logo whooshes)
(hinge squeaks)

00:00:06.443 --> 00:00:08.735
- I am Jonathan Grahm
and I am the chocolatier

00:00:08.735 --> 00:00:11.869
of Compartes Chocolates
here in Los Angeles.

00:00:11.869 --> 00:00:14.261
Being from L.A., I came up
with the kale chocolate bar

00:00:14.261 --> 00:00:16.170
because every single menu
in every single restaurant

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:18.710
was full of kale and I
was like, you know what?

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:21.134
How do we get more people in
L.A. to eat more chocolate?

00:00:21.134 --> 00:00:22.808
This is the answer.

00:00:22.808 --> 00:00:26.148
Ladle it into the mold
just like that and we're

00:00:26.148 --> 00:00:28.378
literally gonna sprinkle and blanket

00:00:28.378 --> 00:00:30.331
each bar with some kale.

00:00:30.331 --> 00:00:32.991
I'm gonna add some pumpkin seeds and then

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:35.813
my last final bit, I'm
gonna take some of these

00:00:35.813 --> 00:00:38.594
beautiful sesame seeds and just
sprinkle them on like that.

00:00:38.594 --> 00:00:39.471
There we are.

00:00:39.471 --> 00:00:40.366
(slide whooshes)

00:00:40.366 --> 00:00:41.700
(upbeat violin music)

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:42.757
- Vegan chocolate?

00:00:42.757 --> 00:00:43.971
Is that even a thing?

00:00:43.971 --> 00:00:45.578
There's obviously some
milk in chocolate, right?

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:47.579
That's how I like to eat my chocolate.

00:00:47.579 --> 00:00:49.913
- I'm vegan so I haven't had
chocolate in like over a year.

00:00:49.913 --> 00:00:51.340
- Ohh.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:52.923
- Kale and seeds?

00:00:52.923 --> 00:00:53.819
Alright.

00:00:53.819 --> 00:00:55.926
- Kale, I hate kale.

00:00:55.926 --> 00:00:58.414
- A forest grew on top of my chocolate.

00:00:58.414 --> 00:01:00.463
- Get your salad outta my chocolate bar.

00:01:00.463 --> 00:01:03.459
- I don't know, this
doesn't look very good.

00:01:03.459 --> 00:01:06.772
(upbeat music)

00:01:06.772 --> 00:01:08.205
- Gosh, I forgot this flavor.

00:01:08.205 --> 00:01:10.086
It's been so long (laughs).

00:01:10.086 --> 00:01:11.947
- I wasn't so sure about the kale because

00:01:11.947 --> 00:01:13.702
it just ruins everything,
but in this chocolate,

00:01:13.702 --> 00:01:14.987
it actually tastes pretty good.

00:01:14.987 --> 00:01:16.332
- The seeds kind of come through.

00:01:16.332 --> 00:01:17.464
It's quite nice actually.

00:01:17.464 --> 00:01:18.602
- Not a fan of it.

00:01:18.602 --> 00:01:23.071
If I'm gonna get chocolate,
I want it to be sweet.

00:01:23.071 --> 00:01:24.081
- I'm not mad.

00:01:24.081 --> 00:01:26.449
- I like kale in my chocolate (laughs),

00:01:26.449 --> 00:01:28.051
maybe that's just me.

00:01:28.051 --> 00:01:30.025
- No animals were harmed
in the making of this,

00:01:30.025 --> 00:01:31.764
which is a plus.

00:01:31.764 --> 00:01:34.104
- So immediately I see
like this huge chunk

00:01:34.104 --> 00:01:35.622
of kale on this chocolate.

00:01:35.622 --> 00:01:37.145
I'm like, what is this about?

00:01:37.145 --> 00:01:38.961
But then again, I see
there's pumpkin seeds

00:01:38.961 --> 00:01:41.305
and I'm like mmmm, love
myself some pumpkin.

